<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech govt measures to contain '96 budget deficit.</title>
<headline>Czech govt measures to contain '96 budget deficit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech government on Wednesday said it had adopted measures to ensure the state budget deficit for 1996 would not exceed one billion crowns, a government spokesman said.</p>
</text>
